# quest/038/BanQiq042_03805 — « The Third Stela: A Feast for Fishmen» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>特殊ルール： レベルアジャスト受注クラス・ジョブ制限</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>コパル古盤のチャクルリ・コテルは、キタリ族による「ナマズ獣人救済説」を唱えているようだ。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Schwierigkeitsanpassung (Job/Klasse darf nicht gewechselt werden)</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Chaqurl Qhotl möchte die Geschichte von der Rettung der Welsleute erzählen.
#. fr: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509>Règle spéciale<nbsp>:  synchronisation de quête avec limitation de job ou de classe</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Chaqurl Qhotl est persuadé que lors des temps difficiles, ses ancêtres n'ont pas hésité à partager leurs ressources avec les mystérieux hommes-poissons-chats. 
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Chaqurl Qhotl would persuade you of the truth of his theory regarding the fate of the mysterious race of catfish people.<br>※The difficulty of this quest will be synced to your current level."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ※本クエストには<br>「<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> レベルアジャスト受注クラス・ジョブ制限」が、<br>　設定されています。<br>　受注時と同じクラスでのみ進行できます。<br><br>チャクルリ・コテルと話した。彼の説に基づき、石碑の復元が行われるという。再びチャクルリ・コテルと話そう。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> Schwierigkeitsanpassung (Job/Klasse darf nicht gewechselt werden)<br><br>Die Qitari sind bereit, den dritten Gedenkstein passend zur Geschichte von Chaqurl Qhotl aufzustellen und warten nur noch auf dein Zeichen. Sprich erneut mit Chaqurl Qhotl.
#. fr: * <i>Cette quête est <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> synchronisée</ui-edge-color></ui-color> avec votre niveau.</i><br>* <i>Il n'est possible de progresser dans cette quête qu'avec la classe ou le job qui a servi à la commencer.</i> <br><br>Vous avez fait savoir à Chaqurl Qhotl que vous partagiez son opinion. La restauration de la stèle va pouvoir commencer sous vos yeux. Parlez à Chaqurl Qhotl lorsque vous souhaiterez que les Qitari se mettent à l'ouvrage.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Convinced of the merits of Chaqurl Qhotl's argument, you express your support for his theory that the Qitari sought to share their food supply with the suffering catfish people, before the latter tribe's unfortunate disappearance from the forest. Grudgingly agreeing that his son may have a point, the stubborn Qitari agrees to assist in the restoration of the third stela.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level. Furthermore, you may not proceed with a class or job that is different from when you accepted this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ルリの発掘隊のキタリたちは、「第三の石碑」の復元完了を、とても喜んでいるようだ。これからも、キタリ族の発掘を手伝っていこう！
#. de: Die Grabenden Pfoten von 'rl haben den dritten Gedenkstein errichtet und freuen sich riesig über ihren Erfolg. Mit deiner Hilfe werden sie hoffentlich noch viele weitere Entdeckungen machen.
#. fr: Les Qitari du plateau de Hopl célèbrent la restauration de la troisième stèle légendaire. Mais les fouilles ne sont pas terminées pour autant<nbsp>!
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Under your watchful eye, the Qitari artisans restore the third stela to Chaqurl Qhotl's best interpretation of its former glory. Encouraged and heartened by reclaiming yet another vital piece of their legacy, the Stewards now pursue their excavation efforts with newfound zeal. Continue to lend them your aid in their efforts should you so desire."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャクルリ・コテルと話す
#. de: Mit Chaqurl Qhotl sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Chaqurl Qhotl
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Chaqurl Qhotl."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そるかしの考えた、キタリ族による「ナマズ獣人救済説」、<br>よいと思ってくださるでござうか？
#. de: Chaqurl erzählt Legende, wie Welsleute gerettet wurden. Gefällt dir Erzählung?
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> souuutenir théorie de Chaqurl Qhotl<nbsp>? <if $gn4>Amie<else>Ami</if> aussi penser que Qitari partager nourriture avec gentils hommes-poissons-chats<nbsp>?
#. speaker: CHAQURLQHOTL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_CHAQURLQHOTL_000_001:1"
msgid "Father may interpret the markings differently, but I am certain that my ancestors were not so cruel and violent as he would say. When famine struck the forest, we Qitari took pity on the catfish people, and shared with them our freshest catches!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「第三の石碑」は、ナマズさんたちとキタリの出会いの場面。<br>森を飢饉が襲った時代……困ったナマズさんに、<br>キタリがお魚を、分けてあげたでござうよ！
#. de: Dritter Gedenkstein ist Erinnerung an Begegnung von Welsleuten mit Qitari. Als vor langer Zeit Wald von großer Hungersnot bedroht wurde, teilten Qitari Fische mit hungrigen Welsleuten!
#. fr: Quand famine frapper forêt, il y a longtemps, Qitari vouloir aider autres peuples. Chaqurl Qhotl être sûûûr<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHAQURLQHOTL
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_CHAQURLQHOTL_000_002:1"
msgid "That they vanished from the Greatwood after this is a pity, but I know that our forefathers did all they could to save their slippery little friends. This is most definitely, most in-<i>tubit</i>-ably the case, do you not agree?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「チャクルリ・コテル」の説を信じてストーリーを進行させると、<br>彼の説に基づき、石碑の復元が行われるようです。<br>「キタルリ・ナトル」の説での復元結果を見ることはできません。
#. de: Wenn du die Geschichte von Chaqurl Qhotl glaubst, wird der passende Gedenkstein dazu aufgestellt. Das Ergebnis der Geschichte von Qitarl Natl bleibt dann verborgen.
#. fr: Si vous choisissez de soutenir la théorie de Chaqurl Qhotl, la stèle des Qitari sera restaurée selon cette hypothèse. Vous ne pourrez pas voir la version proposée par Qitarl Natl.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_SYSTEM_000_003:1"
msgid "If you vouch for Chaqurl Qhotl's theory, the third stela will be restored to reflect his interpretation of history. Proceed, and you will be unable to view the stela as Qitarl Natl envisions it."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なお、どちらを進行しても、得られるアイテムや、<br>今後の友好部族デイリーのコンテンツ内容に、変化はありません。<br>あなたが語られるべきと思う歴史を、選択してください。
#. de: Für welchen Weg du dich auch entscheidest - du wirst dieselben Gegenstände erhalten und dieselben Aufträge spielen können. Deine Wahl hat jedoch Einfluss darauf, wie die Geschichte der Qitari an zukünftige Generationen weitererzählt wird.
#. fr: Les récompenses que vous obtiendrez seront les mêmes dans les deux cas. Suivez donc vos convictions pour faire ce choix.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_SYSTEM_000_004:1"
msgid "The rewards you receive and the content of the quests to follow will be the same regardless of the choice you make. You are free to choose the version of history you find most compelling."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「チャクルリ・コテル」の説を支持して、<br>ストーリーを進行させますか？
#. de: Möchtest du mit der Geschichte von Chaqurl Qhotl fortfahren?
#. fr: Souhaitez-vous soutenir la théorie de Chaqurl Qhotl et poursuivre l'histoire des Qitari<nbsp>?
#. speaker: Q1
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "Lend your support to Chaqurl Qhotl's theory?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: わぁい！！<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>どののオスミツキがあれば、<br>間違いないでござうー！
#. de: Danke, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Du irrst bestimmt nicht!
#. fr: Waaah<nbsp>! Si <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> être d'accord avec Chaqurl Qhotl alors théorie forcément correcte<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHAQURLQHOTL
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_CHAQURLQHOTL_000_006:1"
msgid "Mag-<i>fin</i>-icent! I knew we shared a like mind, you and I."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャクルリの説をお認めいただき……親として嬉しいものにござる。<br>それがしは、石碑の復元を手伝いにまいろう！
#. de: Na schön, wenn <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> Chaqurl unterstützt, hilft Qitarl bei Wiederherstellung von Gedenkstein.
#. fr: Père être très fier de fils... Qitarl Natl aussi aider à restaurer stèle<nbsp>!
#. speaker: QITARLNATL
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_QITARLNATL_000_006:1"
msgid "Perhaps the boy is right, and history is at times not so cruel as it may seem at a glance. In any event, if you truly find his version of events more compelling, I see no reason to object."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「第三の石碑」も、いよいよでござうな！<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>どのにも、見届けてほしいでござうよ。<br>ご準備がよければ、またそるかしに声をかけてくだされ！
#. de: Endlich können Grabende Pfoten dritten Gedenkstein von Ahnen sehen! <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, warten nur noch auf dein Zeichen.
#. fr: Enfin Qitari pouuuvoir faire revivre grande stèle des ancêtres<nbsp>! Chaqurl Qhotl vouloir que <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> voir résultat en premier, alors parler à Chaqurl Qhotl pour commencer restauration.
#. speaker: CHAQURLQHOTL
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_CHAQURLQHOTL_000_007:1"
msgid "Spli-<i>fen</i>-derous! And with that, let's get the restoration of the third stela started! You'll stick around to see that everything is done right, won't you? Whenever you are ready to begin, just say the word!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それじゃあ、さっそく発掘隊の職人さんたちに、<br>石碑をこさえてもらうでござう！
#. de: Los, los, ans Werk! Endlich ist es so weit!
#. fr: Artisans qitari commencer travail<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHAQURLQHOTL
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/038/BanQiq042_03805:TEXT_BANQIQ042_03805_CHAQURLQHOTL_000_008:1"
msgid "Are you ready, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>? Then Father and I shall call for our best artisans at once!"
msgstr ""
